{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-self-reference.md","title":"Self-Referential Solovay Construction","display":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-self-reference"],"display":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","[[89-df-solovay-function]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-self-reference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"571230a8af3bcd56\" href=\"?note=571230a8af3bcd56\" title=\"89-df-sigma-one-formula\">89-df-sigma-one-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" href=\"?note=4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" title=\"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma\">89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2b62c1bcece60ed\" href=\"?note=b2b62c1bcece60ed\" title=\"89-df-solovay-function\">89-df-solovay-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 传递、非自反，根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 到达每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&gt;1\">\\(j&gt;1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\">\\(W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\">\\(R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\\)</span>；有限折叠均按指标递增。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 使用固定标准证明编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,b)\\)</span> 是在 PA 内正确表示该关系的标准证明公式，且 PA 证明一个证明码只有一个末结论。</li>\n<li>对任意候选句子组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U=(U_0,\\ldots,U_n)\">\\(\\vec U=(U_0,\\ldots,U_n)\\)</span>，局部公式缩写\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}\\)</span>。这些是有限算术公式展开式；空析取取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne0\">\\(0\\ne0\\)</span>，空合取取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=0\">\\(0=0\\)</span>，不是新的外部谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span> 为互异算术变元；下述替换均避免捕获。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\)</span> 取已有公式类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to W&#39;\\ \\exists H(a,b)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\\n\\exists S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\nS_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H(a,\\bar j))&amp;(j\\in W&#39;),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H(a,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n(H(a,b)\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H(0,b)\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H(Sa,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c(H(a,c)\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\nh(a+1)=j,&amp;h(a)R&#39;j\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\nh(a+1)=h(a),&amp;\\text{若没有上述 }j,\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models H(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\Longleftrightarrow h(a)=b\n&amp;(a,b\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to W&#39;\\ \\exists H(a,b)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\\n\\exists S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\nS_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H(a,\\bar j))&amp;(j\\in W&#39;),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H(a,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n(H(a,b)\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H(0,b)\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H(Sa,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c(H(a,c)\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\nh(a+1)=j,&amp;h(a)R&#39;j\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\nh(a+1)=h(a),&amp;\\text{若没有上述 }j,\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models H(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\Longleftrightarrow h(a)=b\n&amp;(a,b\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，pp.124–128，特别是 p.127 的有限历史公式和 p.128 的 PA 内递归性质 (1)。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页；p.127 的自指和数码经原页图像核对。</p>\n<p>先对一个候选图公式码定义“否定极限句的码”函数，再把长为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a+1\">\\(a+1\\)</span> 的有限计算历史写成算术公式，使用带参数的广义对角引理，得到同一图公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>。原书的极限句写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\forall a(a\\ge c\\to\\exists b(b=\\bar j\\land H(a,b)))\">\\(\\exists c\\forall a(a\\ge c\\to\\exists b(b=\\bar j\\land H(a,b)))\\)</span>；本条去掉该等号约束的冗余存在变量，取 PA 可证等价的规范形式。编码和有界历史检查可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\)</span> 图公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j\">\\(S_j\\)</span> 是该 H 的实际句法实例，所以不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的句子码不同；一个证明码的唯一末结论保证触发指标至多一个。</p>\n<p>有限历史的追加与截断在 PA 中证明初值和递归等价；PA 归纳证明总性、唯一性与有限值域。每次非停留移动严格沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\">\\(R&#39;\\)</span> 前进，传递性、非自反性及有限值域排除超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次移动；这也可在 PA 内证明。后续极限引理使用的是这些内部事实，不能仅由标准模型中的外部图正确性推得。本条保留原书存在证明的接口；编码函数及其表示证明没有逐条机械展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-sigma-one-formula","status":"resolved","id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"j>1","display":false},{"tex":"W'=W\\cup\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R'=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec U=(U_0,\\ldots,U_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R'}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R'}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner}))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"0=0","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to W'\\ \\exists H(a,b)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\\n\\exists S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\nS_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H(a,\\bar j))&(j\\in W'),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H(a,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n(H(a,b)\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H(0,b)\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H(Sa,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c(H(a,c)\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\nh(a+1)=j,&h(a)R'j\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\nh(a+1)=h(a),&\\text{若没有上述 }j,\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models H(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\Longleftrightarrow h(a)=b\n&(a,b\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"a+1","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\forall a(a\\ge c\\to\\exists b(b=\\bar j\\land H(a,b)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1","display":false},{"tex":"S_j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"R'","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":3850,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 9 章，印刷页 124–127；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限有序候选集有唯一最小元，原始递归给出唯一总函数。该参数化递归本身不要求 $L(v)$ 就是它的极限句；实现原书忠实性所需的自指相容构造另见 [[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]。因此不把任意句族的此递归当作已完成的 Solovay 反解释。原跨书线性序原子定义的是非严格序，这里直接用有限枚举诱导严格序。"},{"id":"2adc36a611449e23","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$h,H,S_0,\\ldots,S_n,W',R'$ 是 [[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] 给出的同一组见证，包含 H 的 PA 内总性、唯一性、有限值域、初值及递归等价，$S_j$ 取该 H 的规范极限句。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]] → [[89-lem-solovay-truth]] → [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-companion]] → [[89-thm-gls-completeness]] → [[89-cor-gls-decidable]] → [[89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","571230a8af3bcd56","4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","b2b62c1bcece60ed","c6ab46cd662b1409"]}